#### UNAVAILABLE-DATA SECTION ####
#### noDataBuckets pair with the no-data-categories pipeline (dev-plan §5.1); `codes` is ####
#### what assigns each ecs code to a bucket. {{state}} is the enclosing state's name. ####
#### `stateData: true` additionally routes into that bucket every metric the tool DOES ####
#### publish for the enclosing state, whatever its ecs code — so the bucket means "state- ####
#### level data exists, here or at ECS" and the other bucket means "nowhere". ####
#### labelSubstate/copySubstate replace label/copy in a county/district/tract view, where ####
#### that merged meaning needs different wording than at states level; {{geography}} is ####
#### the selected geography ("Anderson County, Texas"). ####

{unavailableData}
copy: Not all indicators of success and their related metrics have available data. In some cases, data are not collected at all, are not collected widely, or are not publicly available. Below, we detail which indicators are missing data for this essential question.
{}

[noDataBuckets]
value: state_reported
label: Publicly available in {{state}}
copy: These metrics are not collected at the federal level but can be accessed through this state’s publicly available data, as reported by the Education Commission of the States’ <a href="https://www.ecs.org/state-data-reporting-dashboard/" target="_blank">State Data Reporting Dashboard</a>.
copySubstate: These metrics do not include data for {{geography}}, but data is collected at the state level. Try changing your data level or access the data through this state’s publicly available data, as reported by the Education Commission of the States’ <a href="https://www.ecs.org/state-data-reporting-dashboard/" target="_blank">State Data Reporting Dashboard</a>.
codes: found
stateData: true

value: not_found
label: No data available
copy: These metrics are not available in public data at the federal level or in {{state}}. The <a href="https://studentupwardmobility.urban.org/" target="_blank">Student Upward Mobility Initiative</a> is working to fill these gaps, and we invite schools, institutions, and community-based organizations to partner with us. Email us at <a href="mailto:SUMI@urban.org">SUMI@urban.org</a>.
copySubstate: These metrics are not available in {{geography}}, either because they are not collected in public data at the federal level or because the data is suppressed due to sample size concerns. The <a href="https://studentupwardmobility.urban.org/" target="_blank">Student Upward Mobility Initiative</a> is working to fill some of these gaps, and we invite schools, institutions, and community-based organizations to partner with us. Email us at <a href="mailto:SUMI@urban.org">SUMI@urban.org</a>.
codes: not_found
[]

